   array is allocated at entries_cap(capacity) -- the 2/3 load factor the index
   grows at -- so a copy sized by length would be reallocated out from under
   the next `set`. And below SMALL_MAX there is no index at all: `indices ==
   NULL` is the discriminator every lookup reads, so a copy that allocated one
   would put the source and the duplicate on different code paths. */
